_site/

# Generated by `npm run library` from library/photos/. Committing these meant
# every local build dirtied the tree and blocked the next git pull.
library/manifest.json
library/thumbs/
library/display/

# Gameday frames, filed live into the Tonight shelf and cleared by
# `npm run archive`. They are ephemeral and never belong in version control —
# a test fixture committed here once shipped a fabricated play to the public
# site. The README explaining that stays tracked.
library/photos/tonight/*
!library/photos/tonight/README.md

# Local Worker state and build scratch from `wrangler dev` / `wrangler deploy`.
# Miniflare writes sqlite for D1, KV, R2 and the cache in here; it is per-machine
# and rebuilt on demand.
.wrangler/
